                                "sense_id": "cfc97bef-cfb4-32f4-b46d-18106ad623b6",
                                "text": "The autumn fields were autumn woods now—oak and beech and maple shadiness—as if they had ridden backward through the years of cultivation into primeval forest. The air was cool with mystery as well as with the shadiness."
