                                "text": "\"There were still a lot of government restrictions on how much meat you could get from the packing houses. So I had to turn to certain \"independent\" distributors to get some of the meat cuts my customers wanted.\"\nThere was something about the way Wolff said the word independent that suggested a slight bit of shadiness, but certainly not enough shadiness for a full-blown indictment."
